flowchart TB
  VSC["VS Code<br/>software engineers"]
  IJ["IntelliJ IDEA<br/>Java engineers"]
  SM["SageMaker Studio<br/>data scientists, beside the data<br/><i>CLI in the terminal · Agent SDK in a cell</i>"]
  TERM["Any terminal<br/>site reliability engineers<br/><i>read-only against both clouds</i>"]

  subgraph GOVERNED["Policy lives in the repository — what a session may read, run and change, reviewed like any other change"]
    CC["<b>Claude Code</b><br/>the same tool, the same policy,<br/>wherever the work already happens"]
  end

  BR["<b>Claude on Amazon Bedrock</b><br/>every surface, every session<br/>inference runs in your own AWS account<br/><i>SageMaker runs the client, not the model</i>"]

  subgraph TOOLING["Reached by skill or MCP server"]
    GH["GitHub — review and CI<br/><i>the gh CLI, and an MCP server</i><br/><i>Actions runs the tests on every PR</i>"]
    JIRA["Jira — the delivery record<br/><i>a skill, driving the REST API</i>"]
    SLACK["Slack — where readouts land<br/><i>MCP server</i>"]
    IDEMCP["The IDE itself — diagnostics, open file<br/><i>MCP server</i>"]
  end

  subgraph GCP["GCP"]
    GCPAPP["Customer-facing web"]
    GCPOBS["Logs · metrics · deploy state"]
  end
  subgraph AWS["AWS"]
    AWSAPP["Payments services"]
    AWSOBS["Application logs · metrics · deploy state"]
    CWCC["<b>CloudWatch — Claude Code usage</b><br/>native OTLP endpoints, no collector<br/>sessions · tokens · cost · active time<br/>commits · PRs · lines changed<br/>edit-permission decisions<br/><i>behavioural signal only — prompt content off</i>"]
  end

  VSC --> CC
  IJ --> CC
  SM --> CC
  TERM --> CC

  CC <-->|"the tools around the code"| TOOLING
  CC ==>|"every model call"| BR
  CC ==>|"build and deploy"| AWSAPP
  CC ==>|"build and deploy"| GCPAPP
  CC -->|"OTLP direct — how the tool itself is measured"| CWCC
  AWSOBS -.->|"read-only — what an SRE investigates with"| CC
  GCPOBS -.->|"read-only"| CC

  style TOOLING fill:#f6f4ff,stroke-dasharray:4
  style GOVERNED fill:#f6f4ff,stroke-width:2px
  classDef hub stroke-width:3px;
  classDef plane stroke-width:2px;
  class CC hub;
  class BR plane;
